      "message": "This shouldn\u0027t be necessary.  The USB broadcast triggers tetherMatchingInterfaces() which will do a listInterfaces() and find one.\n\nEventually, we want to require that the USB system send us the exact interface name in the broadcast, and move away from all this interface regex business entirely (it\u0027s awful).\n\nYou can leave this here for now if you like, but just to give you some more context: the interface watching stuff needs to go.\n\nIf you want, you could mock mNWService.listInterfaces() to return [TEST_USB_IFNAME], and it should work just as well.",
